---
description: Route inference, execution, and artifact handoff reviews to the shared model-serving knowledge.
globs:
  - src/algotrading_backend/execution/**
  - src/algotrading_backend/inference/**
  - src/algotrading_backend/entrypoints/**
  - config/execution.yaml
  - config/inference.yaml
alwaysApply: false
---

Apply this rule only in the `algotrading-backend` repository, identified from its project instructions/metadata and `src/algotrading_backend/` package. In any other repository, this rule does not apply.

Use the installed `code-quality` skill with **Serving Preserves the Model Contract** → **Audit Model Serving and Execution**. Follow the project's AGENTS.md and its model-handoff reference. Select the temporal-data route too when a change affects feature availability or train/serve parity.
